rooms_desc ({"Welcome to Ausus's home!When you entered her house you felt like going into one of your (many)fantasies. This large beach-house is built on shore of the Mediterraneansea, but the nature is so unspoilt that you wonder whether it really IS the Mediterranean.You come out of your dream and look around. A piano is standing in the corner, and a very big cosy sofa is standing in the middle of the roomfrom which you can see the sun set.","In this bar you can get every drink you've ever wanted. All the tropicalstuff (of course served with fresh fruit), but also common things liketea and coffee can be bought here.","This bathroom has a the conveniences of the 90's. You see a huge whirlpool, with lights and all that unnecessary stuff, and of coursea huge mirror. (Ausus is kinda vain...)","You enter the bedroom, and the first thing you notice is the huge canopiedbed which is standing right in front of you. All around you are candlesburning; they seem to have been burning here forever.At one wall of the room is a make-up table, and you can see lots ofperfumes, make-up and other girlish stuff standing on it. There are alsosome dresses lying over a chair; all very airy and light.One other wall is completely decorated with lots and lots of photo'sof Ausus' friends.","As you walk onto a large terrace, you can feel a soft sea-breeze runningthrough your hair, and smell the salty sea-water. The terrace is decoratedwith lots of colored lights, and it looks as if it has been used for manyparties. If you would keep walking on, you might as well take a diveinto the azure-blue ocean.","Are you crazy?!, is what you think when you enter this room. All aroundyou are fitness-apparatus, and you wonder 'Why', since the rest of herdomain is such a heavenly paradise. Well, every person on the beach wantsto look slim, and the only way to accomplish that is to work out sometimes.","As you walk further on the terrace, it becomes a large tropical garden.Since the climate is so warm here, exotic flowers are able to grow verywell, and exotic creatures like being here too. Through the whole garden,there's running an artificial stream, and ends in a small waterfall.*","This kitchen is very new, although you know that Ausus uses it lots of timesto (for example) bake one of her famous applepies. She can also cookcomplete meals; maybe she'll make one for you","You decide to take a dive, and splash into the water. The water is very clear, and you cn see lots of fish swimming in it. As you look over thesea towards the land you can see on what a fantastic spot Ausus hasactually built her home. There are palmtrees everywhere, and the climate(as well of the land as the sea) is absolutely perfect.","If you have an allergy, don't go in here. You look around and see about 4cats sitting on soft cushions, and other cat-stuff. They look rather fatand disgustingly spoilt, but I can assure you that they're the sweetestcats oyu've ever seen.",})
